# A busy layered scene, the closest thing here to ordinary footage: a graded
# sky, textured blocks at several depths moving at their own speeds, and small
# fast objects crossing them. Meant as the general-purpose case rather than a
# single stressed path.
name plaza
size 1280 720
frames 90
fps 30
qp 22

bg luma=140 cb=128 cr=128
grad dir=v from=190 to=60 cb_from=160 cb_to=120 cr_from=104 cr_to=140
